  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian cultural orientation programme (NORCO) 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Norwegian Cultural Orientation Programme (NORCO) aims to contribute to the two-way integration of quota refugees into Norwegian society. Information about Norway is provided to beneficiaries prior to their travel to Norway. Information about refugees&apos; country, culture and possible integration challenges is also provided to municipal workers and other stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
